flowchart LR
    U[User goal] --> P[Planner / router]
    P --> G[Policy / risk gate]
    G --> S[Schema-valid call]
    S --> T[Tool adapter / executor]
    T --> V[Tool-result validation]
    V --> C[Confirm / deny / escalate]
    C --> F[Final answer / abstention]
    F -->|bounded retry| P
    MCP[MCP interoperability layer] -. discovery / auth / context .-> P
    MCP -. resources .-> T
